{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd9c8d37fdbdac4581eb038f93bf233dd31d9efd28e2d35cf7a43b837fe6aeb5", "ja": "（昴の初公演が無事に終わった！\nさて、次は昴のこれからを考えていかないと……）", "zh": "（昴的首次公演顺利结束了！那么，接下来得考虑一下昴今后的发展了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "4ac9c218aa3a7842c8f74e0be3d5161e1dc710ad11d30041b09640ea69209457", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れー！\nオレに聞きたいコトがあるんだって？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n听说你有想问我的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "62812dd526ef2d9404a1feac3c82807ce95be39fcbde86a3ac3a97ec7e509505", "ja": "そうなんだ、昴。いろいろあるんだけど……。\nその前に、初公演はどうだった？", "zh": "没错，昴。有很多想问的事……不过在那之前，初次公演感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "e8428fbad54a00aa05e0fe8bbb34116ec1e9d1151c459fe97ada86d349de38bd", "ja": "すっげー楽しかったよ！　全然緊張しなくてさ。\nあれって{$P$}のおかげだよな。", "zh": "特别开心！完全没紧张。\n那都是多亏了{$P$}吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "4c81b06e20ecb98bb6bd5e9427608c96900a0d7e0978c9a5fb4557ef94f28d13", "ja": "まあ、その前のレッスンは結構キツかったけど。\n練習しないとうまくならないのは、野球も一緒だし！", "zh": "不过，在那之前的训练可是相当辛苦的。\n不练习就没法进步，这和棒球也是一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "eb9d37e16b01621ea15f38fa6142d7053c27d4c05a2d276d1c7541b57a561db2", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな。じゃあ、その調子でどんどん\nうまくなって、それでどうするかって話なんだけど……", "zh": "哦，真是可靠啊。那就照这个势头不断进步，接下来该考虑要成为什么样的偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "11de6f72308784c3cf5a2c0cc52194d0171dc650ae4ffb2bbf93a16aa34e6e18", "ja": "昴は、どんなアイドルになりたい？", "zh": "昴，你想成为什么样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "5a1643854846832940e9c2470797d86a1c472d65000039c58883c7a99ffd9686", "ja": "ど、どんなアイドル？\nどんなアイドル、かぁ……うーん……。", "zh": "什、什么样的偶像？\n什么样的偶像啊……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "20699d591f5d920914cb1f4e17735121805a4ca30246b5e3c10b313d9f034b57", "ja": "ううっ……どんなアイドルとか聞かれても、\nオレ、よくわかんないよ～。", "zh": "呜呜……就算你问我是什么样的偶像，\n我也不太明白啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "23c2378f0f5619fabe45f4e777c7d1beeb3d88466b16056cdeb4d37a549bf0a7", "ja": "あれ、イメージ浮かばないか？\nでも昴はたしか、アイドルが好きなんだよな？", "zh": "咦，脑海里没有画面吗？\n不过我记得昴确实挺喜欢偶像的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "3f97f33688f907a7a4711d00daea20901b1b6ed3ead9ab94d0433ac3af0dc3a2", "ja": "うん、好きだよ！　アイドルってみんな、\nすっげーカワイイし！　いいよな～♪", "zh": "嗯，我喜欢啊！偶像们个个都超可爱的！真不错啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9557b648ee3e403960d8b8197dfc4dd5feea4915bc633f64a29aa1e08b5ae9dc", "ja": "そうだな。いろんなアイドルがいるけど、\n昴はどんなアイドルが好きなんだ？", "zh": "是啊。偶像有很多种，\n昴喜欢什么样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "5c070b9081f8457a189fda85e688bde0102afb0f5fe96945622ebcf8876538a4", "ja": "えーと……やっぱかわいくて歌がうまいアイドルかな！\nなんか、見てると楽しくなるっていうかさ。", "zh": "那个……果然还是喜欢可爱又擅长唱歌的偶像吧！\n该怎么说呢，看着看着就会觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "d56cd7323148ed88a6e302855c655634f439215191bacc96f8737706b7a0278c", "ja": "昨日もテレビ見てたんだけど、アイドルが出てくると、\nかわいくてつい見ちゃうんだよな～♪", "zh": "昨天我也在看电视，一看到偶像出来，\n又可爱，就忍不住一直盯着看啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "345246d8b023fe213c0998ed38d5581c3f4be2f16fedfdc7e6acd8c19981b791", "ja": "なるほど。\nじゃあ昴も、そういうアイドルを目指してみようか。", "zh": "原来如此。\n那昴也试着以那样的偶像为目标吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "594f493b65e67da329e934b7e2efe93ef3039b218e31be8d6a3245d2fe7db673", "ja": "ん？　そういうって……ええ～～っ！？\nオ、オレが？　あんなカワイイアイドルに？？", "zh": "嗯？你说的那种是指……诶诶——！？\n我、我吗？要成为那么可爱的偶像？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "92eb03cc2c9520e390a107c74ba0fd60ea03f601b42c641ddbd9d5a7587008ba", "ja": "そう、見ていて楽しくなるような、かわいくて\n歌がうまいアイドルを、昴が目指すんだ。", "zh": "没错，昴要以成为那种让人看着就觉得开心、既可爱又擅长唱歌的偶像为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ad54376d0be3b96dec835da9569f64a4be27346b441b740370ecf919c795dbb", "ja": "ま、マジか！　オレが……？\nうーん……なれるかな～？", "zh": "真、真的吗！我……？\n唔——我能成为那样的人吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8570e2c4ef4a2737f22245d73a76a62eb566d78b9d7abf6eb9f6521a48c0c3a7", "ja": "もちろん、すべては昴のがんばり次第かな。\nでも……。", "zh": "当然，这一切都取决于昴的努力。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "05a1ba92847fa6be6c3e5192b419f426b58ea958b091378c9e1f50097cafbfd8", "ja": "昴ならなれる。\nそう思ったから、スカウトしたんだよ。", "zh": "因为我觉得昴能做到，\n才去挖掘你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4334ac6accb28cd02306d25db9e04f9eafb959732f2d01da0f39ba077a72475", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそ、そっか……！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n这、这样啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "64543324719ecce8b0a9cbb060fe30a5bdb7f5ee4dd7a1dee781e0edcae367da", "ja": "えへへ、わかった。オレ、がんばってみるよ！\nがんばるだけなら、オレにもできるもんな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，知道了。我也会努力试试的！\n只是努力的话，我也做得到嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1877b53c5c03e124a87de35f55c04cef7db6df76648041a87412980aec50ddca", "ja": "そうそう。それに、がんばるのは昴だけじゃないぞ。\n劇場のみんなも、プロデューサーの俺も一緒だからな！", "zh": "没错。而且，努力的不只是昴。剧场里的大家，还有我这个制作人，也会陪你一起努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "e0cc0d02c92d41298720ed33d08597e59ed7a8e83bf9a9567fb90ab05715202a", "ja": "うん！　へへ、サンキュな、{$P$}！\nなんかオレ、ホントになれる気がしてきたよ！", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿，谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我好像真的开始觉得，自己能做到啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "006cda7dc69b9682fdf1dbc6dd9889815a62e9016e86e706cea14e45d49f2193", "ja": "バッティングもさ、素振りが大事なんだ。\nだから歌も、いっぱい歌えばうまくなるよな、きっと！", "zh": "击球也是，练习挥棒很重要。\n所以唱歌也是，只要多唱几遍，就一定能唱得更好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "35652bb7d289f14f8bf60007517a1a5bc0d3b173bf23f29bcaac86e6a125c074", "ja": "かわいくなる方も、いっぱい……いっぱい……あれ？\nかわいくなる練習って、何すればいいんだ？", "zh": "变得可爱这方面，也要多……多……咦？\n要练习变可爱的话，该做些什么才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ac50d3c63987c6d81ee24cb20d77dcc418d6b93d1cdfc5ce268a07bc4ef42550", "ja": "それは……不思議なもので、ステージにたくさん出ると\nかわいくなったりするんだ。", "zh": "那是……很不可思议的事，只要多登上几次舞台，就会变得可爱起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "84e666263f03885a61eefe50c578f94458b9453a82870e580d750d1f3cd6802d", "ja": "ええっ、マジかよ！？　すっげー！！\nステージってすげーんだな！！", "zh": "诶，真的假的！？太厉害了！！\n舞台真是不得了啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "62cd3da0bc7b6da1a4795632b5755c7bbcdf9cd9c9d5b9425a185fdcc7fb729c", "ja": "ああ、アイドルのステージは本当にすげ……すごいぞ！\nだからこれからも、一緒にがんばろうな！", "zh": "啊，偶像的舞台真的好厉害……不，是很厉害啊！所以今后也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "f2a4d6ddd3b8a665f18ef5169dfab5ca347496bd9041023d012898cf7a5fca84", "ja": "わかった！　それじゃオレ、これからもいっぱい\nステージに出られるように、がんばるよ！", "zh": "知道了！那我今后也会努力，争取能有更多登上舞台的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2b1f247ad240d1b6cd3f69c348ed82077fe8faf337cc1172fc8fe343c1009d6f", "ja": "（アイドルのステージは、女の子に魔法をかける。\nしっかりプロデュースして、昴を送り出していこう！）", "zh": "（偶像的舞台，会给女孩子施展魔法。好好做好制作，把昴送上舞台吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
